    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this 3 bedroom end of terrace home to the market located right in the heart of Clondalkin village.  The property benefits from a selection of Primary & Secondary schools which are all within walking distance, shops, bars and restaurants are a stone's throw away. From a transport point of view, the area is well serviced by bus routes and road networks such as the M50 & N7. Corkagh Park and other recreational facilities are also within easy reach.\nInternal accommodation of c. 75 sqm comprises an entrance hallway, living room, kitchen, three well-proportioned bedrooms and a main family bathroom. To the rear is an extra large sunny garden which is not overlooked and the front offers off street parking for multiple cars. .\nNo 22 is presented as a blank canvas but offers buyers an excellent opportunity to put their own stamp on the home.\nThe long list of additional features includes dual aspect living space, spacious bedrooms and double glazed window. Early viewing is highly advised so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to arrange a viewing or register your interest today.\n\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>3 bed, 1 bath</li>\n <li>Terraced home with side entrance</li>\n <li>XL private rear garden which is not overlooked</li>\n <li>Boasts massive potential</li>\n <li>Blank canvas with huge potential</li>\n <li>Driveway to front offers off-street parking</li>\n <li>Prime location close to all essential amenities</li>\n <li>Easy access to major routes & road networks</li>\n <li>Early viewing highly advised!</li>\n</ul>\n\nBER details\nBER: G\n\nDirections\nEircode: D22 A6Y1"
      },
      {
